*** Begin ECU Patch
Key: 016-renew-missing-workbench-sandbox
Title: Renew missing Workbench sandbox leases
Purpose: Keep repeated Workbench review reactions usable when an ephemeral Daytona sandbox has disappeared.

*** Begin Context
The Workbench stores a durable Context and Instant app, but its backing Daytona sandbox is ephemeral. A cached sandbox id can later fail with provider errors such as "Sandbox with ID or name ... not found" or with the durable sandbox row already marked shutdown after a failed reconnect.

This patch moves sandbox selection from a fixed id passed into the review reaction to a reaction sandbox resolver. The resolver probes the cached lease with a minimal command, replaces only missing or terminal leases under a shared lock, preserves the current app/context/history, and propagates credential/network/non-terminal failures instead of hiding them.

Verification:
