- pnpm typecheck in packages/workbench-v3: passed.
- pnpm build in packages/workbench-v3: passed with existing optional dependency warnings.
- Real POST /api/context review scenario with gpt-5.6-sol completed HTTP 200 in 198.32s after creating/using real sandbox + dataset path.
